// CATEGORY: codegen
// DESCRIPTION: trait impl method return type mismatch
// EXPECTED: compile_error
// ERROR_PATTERN: method
// SOURCE: Stage 18.69 — Stage 18.71 fix (was Stage 0 limitation, now correctly rejected): trait impl signature not validated against trait declaration

